# Chapter 9 requests. Start the app first: dotnet run (https://localhost:42109, Development).
# Send the requests in order. Each "Expect" line is the status you should see.
# Signing in sets this host's cookie. VS Code REST Client keeps it for the next requests; if your
# client does not keep cookies, use the curl.exe commands in README.md instead.
# Restart the app to reset the document store before you repeat the checks.

@host = https://localhost:42109

###
# Public page. Expect 200: "Public AdventureWorks documentation"
GET {{host}}/

###
# Anonymous request to a protected document. Expect 401
GET {{host}}/api/documents/1

###
# Anonymous archive request. Expect 401
POST {{host}}/api/documents/1/archive

###
# Sign in as owner: owner-1, no Department, under 21. Expect 200
POST {{host}}/dev/sign-in/owner

###
# The age policy rejects this user. Expect 403
GET {{host}}/restricted-content

###
# The owner can read the document. Expect 200 with "archived": false
GET {{host}}/api/documents/1

###
# Antiforgery token for this user. Expect 200
# @name ownerToken
GET {{host}}/csrf

###
# Not in Finance, so the Department:Finance policy rejects the archive. Expect 403
POST {{host}}/api/documents/1/archive
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{ownerToken.response.body.$.token}}

###
# Sign in as finance-nonowner: owner-2, Department Finance. Expect 200
POST {{host}}/dev/sign-in/finance-nonowner

###
# Expect 200
# @name nonOwnerToken
GET {{host}}/csrf

###
# In Finance but not the owner, so the ownership check rejects it. Expect 403
POST {{host}}/api/documents/1/archive
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{nonOwnerToken.response.body.$.token}}

###
# Sign in as finance-owner: owner-1, Department Finance, born 1990. Expect 200
POST {{host}}/dev/sign-in/finance-owner

###
# The age policy accepts this user. Expect 200: "Age policy accepted"
GET {{host}}/restricted-content

###
# Expect 200
# @name financeOwnerToken
GET {{host}}/csrf

###
# Without the antiforgery token the archive is rejected. Expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/documents/1/archive

###
# Finance membership and ownership both succeed. Expect 204
POST {{host}}/api/documents/1/archive
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{financeOwnerToken.response.body.$.token}}

###
# The document is now archived. Expect 200 with "archived": true
GET {{host}}/api/documents/1

###
# Sign in as admin: role Admin. Expect 200
POST {{host}}/dev/sign-in/admin

###
# Expect 200
# @name adminToken
GET {{host}}/csrf

###
# Admins can delete. Expect 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/1
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{adminToken.response.body.$.token}}

###
# The document is gone. Expect 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/1
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{adminToken.response.body.$.token}}

###
# Unknown test users do not exist. Expect 404
POST {{host}}/dev/sign-in/someone-else

###
# Sign out. Expect 204
POST {{host}}/dev/sign-out
